WEBVTT

00:03.920 --> 00:05.390
<b>Eri!</b>

00:07.590 --> 00:10.330
<b>Hurry up and ready the next blast.</b>

00:10.330 --> 00:11.990
<b><i>It will take time to recharge.</i></b>

00:11.990 --> 00:14.790
<b>In that case, send out our mobile suits.</b>

00:21.600 --> 00:22.830
<b><i>Ericht!</i></b>

00:22.830 --> 00:24.330
<b>Answer me, Ericht!</b>

00:25.110 --> 00:26.080
<b>Ericht!</b>

00:27.690 --> 00:29.010
<b>What do I do?</b>

00:29.010 --> 00:29.930
<b>What do I do?!</b>

00:29.930 --> 00:30.840
<b><i>Suletta!</i></b>

00:31.530 --> 00:32.430
<b><i>Suletta!</i></b>

00:32.430 --> 00:33.930
<b><i>Ms. Suletta!</i></b>

00:33.930 --> 00:34.760
<b>Are you okay?</b>

00:35.410 --> 00:37.390
<b>Mr. Guel... everyone...!</b>

00:44.290 --> 00:45.080
<b>Suletta!</b>

00:45.080 --> 00:45.940
<b>Ms. Suletta!</b>

00:52.550 --> 00:54.780
<b><i>Suletta! Do you read me?</i></b>

00:54.780 --> 00:56.200
<b><i>Suletta!</i></b>

02:30.110 --> 02:31.750
<b>Pretty gruesome...</b>

02:32.240 --> 02:34.560
<b>What... happened to her?</b>

02:35.960 --> 02:40.060
<b>Spread of information
thermological entropy confirmed.</b>

02:40.060 --> 02:43.270
<b>It has reached the level
where her body is under threat.</b>

02:44.760 --> 02:46.360
<b>Ms. Suletta!</b>

02:46.360 --> 02:47.940
<b>Are you in pain?</b>

02:48.540 --> 02:49.610
<b>How is Ericht?</b>

02:49.610 --> 02:52.270
<b>Till and the others
are checking things out.</b>

02:53.090 --> 02:54.780
<b>No! You can't get up yet!</b>

02:54.780 --> 02:55.860
<b>I have to go...</b>

02:56.340 --> 02:58.080
<b>Ericht is...</b>

02:58.080 --> 02:59.490
<b>That blast just now...</b>

02:59.860 --> 03:03.460
<b>It was probably an interplanetary laser
transmission system at high output.</b>

03:03.460 --> 03:07.380
<b>Which means, it will take time
to recharge for the next blast.</b>

03:07.380 --> 03:08.370
<b>In that case...</b>

03:10.360 --> 03:12.080
<b>I'll go make some tea.</b>

03:12.730 --> 03:14.040
<b><i>What was that?</i></b>

03:14.450 --> 03:16.250
<b>What happened to Suletta and the others?</b>

03:18.460 --> 03:19.760
<b>You...</b>

03:19.760 --> 03:21.180
<b>Your body...</b>

03:21.180 --> 03:23.840
<b>Hey, we'd better blow this joint.</b>

03:25.700 --> 03:27.180
<b>Nobody move!</b>

03:27.180 --> 03:29.040
<b>Nika! Chuchu!</b>

03:29.040 --> 03:30.520
<b>I'm here too, you know!</b>

03:30.820 --> 03:33.450
<b>President Miorine... it's over.</b>

03:33.450 --> 03:34.780
<b>You know what to do.</b>

03:35.800 --> 03:37.120
<b><i>Attention Headquarters!</i></b>

03:37.120 --> 03:39.610
<b>Any further attacks
are in violation of law!</b>

03:40.100 --> 03:42.950
<b>After violating the principles
of peace between the fronts,</b>

03:42.950 --> 03:46.080
<b>the Benerit Group has no leg to stand on.</b>

03:46.080 --> 03:48.000
<b>As defenders of the fronts,</b>

03:48.000 --> 03:50.920
<b>the Space Assembly League
is acting with cause.</b>

03:51.350 --> 03:53.880
<b>How was Ms. Ericht?</b>

03:53.880 --> 03:55.790
<b>She didn't respond...</b>

03:56.170 --> 03:58.090
<b>The drive systems are all damaged.</b>

03:58.530 --> 04:00.180
<b>That might be why.</b>

04:00.180 --> 04:01.510
<b>Give us ten minutes!</b>

04:01.510 --> 04:05.690
<b>We'll shift Aerial's
propulsion controls to the Calibarn!</b>

04:05.690 --> 04:08.270
<b>We may not be as good as Nika,</b>

04:08.270 --> 04:11.770
<b>but we've spent plenty of time
working on Aerial too, you know.</b>

04:17.840 --> 04:19.150
<b>I...</b>

04:19.150 --> 04:21.360
<b>haven't forgiven you people.</b>

04:21.360 --> 04:22.780
<b>Mr. Lauda?</b>

04:23.800 --> 04:24.740
<b>But...</b>

04:25.220 --> 04:27.700
<b>if you don't come home with my brother,</b>

04:27.700 --> 04:29.790
<b>I'll forgive that even less.</b>

04:31.650 --> 04:33.090
<b><i>Right.</i></b>

04:40.150 --> 04:41.690
<b><i>We'll head straight there.</i></b>

04:41.690 --> 04:42.260
<b><i>Right!</i></b>

04:46.870 --> 04:48.350
<b><i>The Space Assembly League?</i></b>

04:49.010 --> 04:50.660
<b>At a time like this?</b>

04:52.670 --> 04:55.690
<b><i>President Jeturk, please return
to Quiet Zero immediately.</i></b>

04:55.690 --> 04:57.570
<b><i>Focus on your duties.</i></b>

04:58.940 --> 05:00.280
<b><i>Forgive me...</i></b>

05:03.840 --> 05:06.310
<b>A wireless optical transmission?</b>

05:06.310 --> 05:07.830
<b>Are you sure?</b>

05:08.270 --> 05:10.580
<b>We have no orders to engage them.</b>

05:11.690 --> 05:14.420
<b><i>Do you want to get caught
in that thing's line of fire?</i></b>

05:14.980 --> 05:17.120
<b><i>A laser transmission system?</i></b>

05:17.120 --> 05:20.470
<b>It's supposed to be
an infrastructure front,</b>

05:20.470 --> 05:22.050
<b>providing power to Lagrange 1.</b>

05:22.050 --> 05:25.020
<b>I'd heard rumors that
it might be co-opted for military use.</b>

05:25.020 --> 05:28.090
<b>I'll say it one more time.
Hand over Aerial.</b>

05:28.090 --> 05:32.690
<b>Otherwise, your lives will end here.</b>

05:32.690 --> 05:33.520
<b>I told you, didn't I?</b>

05:34.460 --> 05:37.730
<b>Suletta cares about you a lot.</b>

05:38.420 --> 05:40.310
<b>She'll come without being told...</b>

05:42.550 --> 05:45.490
<b><i>Along with Aerial.</i></b>

05:49.680 --> 05:51.290
<b><i>Suletta...</i></b>

05:51.950 --> 05:53.460
<b>We're here.</b>

05:54.640 --> 05:56.130
<b>Mom...</b>

06:02.750 --> 06:03.920
<b>Suletta!</b>

06:05.420 --> 06:07.670
<b>Ms. Miorine, Ms. Nika!</b>

06:07.670 --> 06:08.800
<b>Everyone!</b>

06:10.210 --> 06:12.110
<b>Thank you, Suletta.</b>

06:13.170 --> 06:17.240
<b><i>If you reconnect the continuity chord,
Eri will reawaken!</i></b>

06:17.240 --> 06:18.480
<b>Good...</b>

06:19.350 --> 06:23.400
<b>Now, please connect Eri to Quiet Zero.</b>

06:26.100 --> 06:27.500
<b>What's wrong?</b>

06:28.360 --> 06:29.410
<b><i>No.</i></b>

06:33.360 --> 06:34.410
<b>I won't...</b>

06:35.530 --> 06:36.660
<b>hand Ericht to you.</b>

06:38.620 --> 06:40.170
<b>Listen to me, Suletta...</b>

06:41.990 --> 06:46.210
<b>Your mom's body will be paralyzed soon.</b>

06:49.000 --> 06:51.840
<b>I've managed to put on a good act,</b>

06:51.840 --> 06:54.170
<b>but my legs have been useless for a while.</b>

06:54.170 --> 06:56.060
<b>Data storm infection?</b>

06:57.300 --> 06:58.390
<b>Still...</b>

06:58.890 --> 07:00.770
<b>I don't care about any of that.</b>

07:01.260 --> 07:06.730
<b>Eri will gain a world woven by GUND,
and her freedom as well.</b>

07:06.730 --> 07:11.280
<b>All of us can find happiness
in their respective places of being.</b>

07:11.780 --> 07:12.910
<b>Suletta!</b>

07:14.280 --> 07:18.410
<b>If you care about Eri,
you can move forward too, right?</b>

07:20.740 --> 07:23.380
<b>You're wrong, Mom.</b>

07:25.410 --> 07:28.450
<b>I don't want to lose you.</b>

07:28.450 --> 07:32.900
<b>I'm sure Ericht doesn't want
to lose you, either.</b>

07:38.630 --> 07:39.520
<b>So...</b>

07:40.550 --> 07:42.390
<b>who needs...</b>

07:43.680 --> 07:45.120
<b><i>this Quiet Zero thing!</i></b>

07:49.610 --> 07:51.240
<b>Stop it, Suletta.</b>

07:51.730 --> 07:53.320
<b><i>You can't handle it.</i></b>

08:11.830 --> 08:14.650
<b>Are you... in trouble again?</b>

08:16.000 --> 08:18.060
<b><i>Mr... Elan?</i></b>

08:19.840 --> 08:21.370
<b><i>How?</i></b>

08:21.930 --> 08:26.400
<b>The organoid archive of
the enhanced humans is integrated here.</b>

08:26.930 --> 08:29.860
<b>I guess that means I'm like her.</b>

08:32.900 --> 08:34.110
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

08:35.520 --> 08:38.090
<b><i>Mr. Elan, it was my fault that you...</i></b>

08:39.650 --> 08:42.720
<b>I don't regret dueling with you.</b>

08:43.660 --> 08:46.310
<b>On the contrary, I'm sorry...</b>

08:46.740 --> 08:48.540
<b>that I couldn't meet you like I promised.</b>

08:50.320 --> 08:51.360
<b>No...</b>

08:52.540 --> 08:53.940
<b>It's fine!</b>

08:56.160 --> 08:59.100
<b>Let's begin, Suletta Mercury.</b>

09:00.550 --> 09:01.550
<b><i>Right!</i></b>

09:07.560 --> 09:08.860
<b>The data storm?</b>

09:17.520 --> 09:18.820
<b>Please, Ericht!</b>

09:19.780 --> 09:21.260
<b><i>Answer me!</i></b>

09:33.650 --> 09:35.670
<b>You're so silly, Suletta.</b>

09:35.670 --> 09:38.190
<b>You can choose for yourself.</b>

09:38.190 --> 09:39.760
<b>You have a place where you belong.</b>

09:40.840 --> 09:43.910
<b>And yet... this is what you want?</b>

09:46.010 --> 09:46.980
<b><i>I'm...</i></b>

09:47.470 --> 09:49.160
<b>a greedy person.</b>

09:49.160 --> 09:52.020
<b>There's so much I want to do</b>

09:52.890 --> 09:54.300
<b><i>with Mom and all of you!</i></b>

10:04.070 --> 10:05.010
<b>Okay.</b>

10:36.230 --> 10:37.900
<b><i>Is it Quiet Zero?</i></b>

10:37.900 --> 10:40.800
<b>No. No signs of attack.</b>

10:40.800 --> 10:41.950
<b><i>What?</i></b>

10:45.450 --> 10:46.410
<b><i>Ms. Miorine!</i></b>

10:46.410 --> 10:48.010
<b>Suletta?</b>

10:48.010 --> 10:50.430
<b><i>Quiet Zero is being targeted again!</i></b>

10:50.430 --> 10:52.580
<b><i>Everyone, please flee!</i></b>

10:52.580 --> 10:54.350
<b><i>You too, Mom!</i></b>

10:54.350 --> 10:55.770
<b>Don't move.</b>

10:55.770 --> 10:57.510
<b>Not another inch--</b>

10:59.290 --> 11:01.760
<b>We just need to rid the League
of their motives, right?</b>

11:05.880 --> 11:07.370
<b><i>Lagrange 4!</i></b>

11:07.370 --> 11:11.700
<b><i>And all citizens in the region!
Can you hear me?</i></b>

11:12.180 --> 11:14.020
<b>Ms. Miorine?</b>

11:14.020 --> 11:17.730
<b><i>I'm the President of the Benerit Group...</i></b>

11:14.020 --> 11:17.730
<b>Whose voice is that? Cut it off!</b>

11:17.730 --> 11:19.250
<b><i>...Miorine Rembran.</i></b>

11:17.730 --> 11:19.250
<b>I can't.</b>

11:19.250 --> 11:20.950
<b>But this is the moon!</b>

11:20.950 --> 11:26.850
<b><i>The Benerit Group has just submitted
its papers of dissolution and liquidation.</i></b>

11:26.850 --> 11:27.910
<b>What?</b>

11:27.910 --> 11:32.170
<b><i>As was the case with Grassley,
all of the group's assets</i></b>

11:32.170 --> 11:36.690
<b><i>will be sold to or merged with
Earthian corporations,</i></b>

11:36.690 --> 11:38.690
<b><i>per mutual agreement.</i></b>

11:38.690 --> 11:40.030
<b><i>In addition...</i></b>

11:38.690 --> 11:40.030
<b>Dissolution?</b>

11:40.030 --> 11:42.030
<b><i>we've received evidence that...</i></b>

11:40.920 --> 11:42.030
<b>For real?</b>

11:42.030 --> 11:45.100
<b><i>the League's High Council colluded
with Grassley Defense Systems...</i></b>

11:42.030 --> 11:45.100
<b>How? When did that happen?</b>

11:45.100 --> 11:48.590
<b><i>...and was complicit
in the recent attacks.</i></b>

11:48.590 --> 11:51.600
<b><i>The evidence was received, along with
Shaddiq Zenelli's written confession,</i></b>

11:52.100 --> 11:54.790
<b><i>and we promise to make it public!</i></b>

11:55.600 --> 11:59.230
<b>As always...
I could never compete with you.</b>

12:00.350 --> 12:02.740
<b><i>Alea iacta est.</i></b>

12:05.230 --> 12:07.670
<b>Was this at his request?</b>

12:07.670 --> 12:09.290
<b>Who knows...</b>

12:10.780 --> 12:12.100
<b>Shall we go?</b>

12:14.030 --> 12:17.390
<b>Miorine... Rembran!</b>

12:17.390 --> 12:18.480
<b>But that's...</b>

12:18.480 --> 12:20.570
<b>What about our assets?</b>

12:20.570 --> 12:23.550
<b>Looks like she sold every last bit.</b>

12:25.170 --> 12:26.400
<b>You're resigning?!</b>

12:26.400 --> 12:28.350
<b>I guess you could say
I've been headhunted...</b>

12:28.840 --> 12:31.730
<b>I've grown tired of being
on the Peil Grade's leash, anyway.</b>

12:32.590 --> 12:33.830
<b>Buh-bye!</b>

12:35.470 --> 12:37.070
<b>It's not over yet.</b>

12:37.070 --> 12:40.840
<b><i>That weapon of mass destruction
still stands.</i></b>

12:41.940 --> 12:44.780
<b>The energy recharge is still underway.</b>

12:44.780 --> 12:46.630
<b>Suletta! Run!</b>

12:46.630 --> 12:47.450
<b><i>No.</i></b>

12:47.940 --> 12:49.800
<b>I'll stop them!</b>

13:35.200 --> 13:37.420
<b><i>The laser transmission system
has been overridden.</i></b>

13:37.420 --> 13:40.290
<b><i>The firing phase has been shut down.</i></b>

13:43.760 --> 13:45.800
<b>Incredible.</b>

13:45.800 --> 13:49.150
<b>She actually exceeded... score eight...</b>

13:53.930 --> 13:57.390
<b><i>Suletta is the only one
capable of raising Eri's score.</i></b>

13:58.180 --> 13:59.980
<b>That must be it.</b>

14:00.930 --> 14:02.330
<b>Elnora...</b>

14:06.150 --> 14:08.860
<b>Come home to the children.</b>

14:09.400 --> 14:12.030
<b>Nadeem? How?</b>

14:12.570 --> 14:14.360
<b>It's over.</b>

14:14.360 --> 14:16.620
<b>You made us all proud.</b>

14:17.370 --> 14:20.390
<b>But isn't it still too early
for her to come here?</b>

14:20.390 --> 14:21.380
<b>Just come home.</b>

14:21.870 --> 14:24.150
<b>You've done enough, haven't you?</b>

14:26.080 --> 14:27.130
<b>I can't.</b>

14:28.000 --> 14:30.570
<b>I could never forgive myself.</b>

14:31.130 --> 14:32.700
<b>I lost Nadeem,</b>

14:33.090 --> 14:34.570
<b>Dr. Cardo...</b>

14:35.220 --> 14:36.930
<b>all of you!</b>

14:37.840 --> 14:39.950
<b>If I lose Eri too...</b>

14:42.020 --> 14:43.900
<b>I'm proud of you, Mom.</b>

14:46.270 --> 14:47.980
<b>Suletta...</b>

14:47.980 --> 14:50.980
<b>You called everyone here from Aerial,
didn't you?</b>

14:50.980 --> 14:55.850
<b>For Ericht's sake,
you chose the future over revenge.</b>

14:57.530 --> 14:59.600
<b>Even if everyone objects,</b>

14:59.950 --> 15:02.020
<b>if they say that it's wrong,</b>

15:02.700 --> 15:04.590
<b>your choice...</b>

15:05.790 --> 15:08.020
<b>has my support.</b>

15:12.170 --> 15:14.990
<b>What you... you know...</b>

15:15.720 --> 15:16.930
<b>Mom!</b>

15:35.190 --> 15:38.930
<b>I want to stay with Suletta from now on.</b>

15:40.200 --> 15:41.680
<b>With you too, Mom.</b>

15:47.550 --> 15:49.400
<b>I'm so sorry...</b>

15:50.500 --> 15:51.550
<b>Eri...</b>

15:52.420 --> 15:53.820
<b><i>Suletta...</i></b>

16:01.600 --> 16:03.040
<b>What's happening?</b>

16:03.040 --> 16:05.500
<b>The Permet is breaking apart
at the particle level.</b>

16:05.500 --> 16:07.640
<b><i>Please evacuate.</i></b>

16:31.210 --> 16:33.260
<b>Quiet Zero...</b>

16:34.360 --> 16:35.840
<b>...disappeared?</b>

18:01.840 --> 18:04.740
<b>Ms... Miorine?</b>

18:05.970 --> 18:08.690
<b>Answer me sooner,</b>

18:09.180 --> 18:10.710
<b>you idiot!</b>

18:15.820 --> 18:18.700
<b>3 years later</b>

18:20.030 --> 18:20.960
<b>Nika!</b>

18:23.860 --> 18:25.470
<b>Welcome back!</b>

18:25.470 --> 18:27.210
<b><i>How was the certification test?</i></b>

18:28.710 --> 18:30.890
<b>Congratulations!</b>

18:30.890 --> 18:33.460
<b>I expect nothing less
from our ace mechanic.</b>

18:33.460 --> 18:35.480
<b>You'll have to balance
work and school now.</b>

18:35.480 --> 18:36.460
<b>I'll do my best!</b>

18:36.460 --> 18:37.720
<b><i>Where's Chuchu?</i></b>

18:37.720 --> 18:38.720
<b>Rouji!</b>

18:39.200 --> 18:42.240
<b><i>You changed the specs without asking!
You turdish Spacian geek--</i></b>

18:42.240 --> 18:44.450
<b>That qualifies as verbal harassment...</b>

18:44.450 --> 18:45.720
<b>What did you say?!</b>

18:50.060 --> 18:52.270
<b>She could have at least
written the location...</b>

18:53.980 --> 18:55.980
<b>Why did you lie?</b>

18:56.690 --> 19:01.760
<b>Plant Quetta was one thing,
but Quiet Zero was not your crime.</b>

19:03.490 --> 19:05.920
<b>I'd decided on my own, long ago.</b>

19:07.530 --> 19:09.100
<b>Are you leaving for Quinharbor?</b>

19:09.100 --> 19:10.020
<b>Yes.</b>

19:10.020 --> 19:13.000
<b>Making up for things
will be hard for both of us.</b>

19:13.000 --> 19:15.360
<b>The trial is about to commence.</b>

19:16.080 --> 19:17.770
<b>I'm off, then.</b>

19:17.770 --> 19:19.760
<b>Thank you, Miorine.</b>

19:21.380 --> 19:22.780
<b>Goodbye.</b>

19:24.260 --> 19:25.140
<b>Are you sure?</b>

19:25.140 --> 19:26.240
<b>About what?</b>

19:26.240 --> 19:27.660
<b>You're not honest with yourself.</b>

19:27.660 --> 19:28.560
<b>Shut up!</b>

19:28.560 --> 19:32.330
<b>I wish you'd listen to
your sister-in-law's advice.</b>

19:32.810 --> 19:36.110
<b>You sure remind me of your mother.</b>

19:36.890 --> 19:40.610
<b>I'll be a tester for GUND-ARM Inc.
starting next week.</b>

19:40.610 --> 19:42.780
<b>I want to be at Petra's side.</b>

19:43.780 --> 19:46.660
<b><i>I can't rely on my big brother forever.</i></b>

19:46.660 --> 19:49.100
<b>I see. Well, see you soon.</b>

19:49.950 --> 19:51.210
<b>Mr. Ceres...</b>

19:51.210 --> 19:54.060
<b>I'm grateful that
you'd bring me new business, but...</b>

19:54.060 --> 19:57.170
<b>I helped keep Asticassia open, didn't I?</b>

19:57.170 --> 20:01.360
<b><i>And I helped you find new jobs
for your employees.</i></b>

20:01.360 --> 20:02.930
<b><i>Now it's your turn to listen.</i></b>

20:02.930 --> 20:05.700
<b>Listen to what, exactly?</b>

20:05.700 --> 20:08.160
<b>I'm the one who drew up the documents.</b>

20:08.160 --> 20:11.140
<b>The division of profits
seems awfully stingy.</b>

20:11.140 --> 20:14.400
<b>Well, you want to rebuild
your company, right?</b>

20:14.400 --> 20:17.320
<b>President Jeturk...</b>

20:42.460 --> 20:45.530
<b>The Benerit Group assets we distributed...</b>

20:45.530 --> 20:49.000
<b><i>They'll just be scooped up by space again.</i></b>

20:49.000 --> 20:51.450
<b><i>I wonder if it was the right move.</i></b>

20:51.980 --> 20:55.160
<b>There are as many "right moves"
as there are individuals.</b>

20:55.160 --> 20:57.980
<b>We all make mistakes at some point.</b>

20:59.020 --> 21:00.980
<b>But we have to keep doing what we can.</b>

21:01.480 --> 21:02.920
<b>In the future, as well.</b>

21:20.660 --> 21:22.570
<b>You're going to make a school here too?</b>

21:22.570 --> 21:23.380
<b>Yes.</b>

21:23.880 --> 21:26.880
<b>I've gradually regained
control of my body,</b>

21:27.380 --> 21:30.540
<b>and my mom likes it here too.</b>

21:31.870 --> 21:35.020
<b>I don't get what's so great
about living in the countryside.</b>

21:35.400 --> 21:38.890
<b>Well, I don't get how you even exist.</b>

21:38.890 --> 21:40.770
<b>It's not like I do, either.</b>

21:41.040 --> 21:42.400
<b>But...</b>

21:42.400 --> 21:46.380
<b><i>the one who transferred us
from Aerial that day...</i></b>

21:46.380 --> 21:48.330
<b><i>was definitely you, Suletta.</i></b>

21:49.030 --> 21:52.390
<b>It was something that only you could do.</b>

21:54.320 --> 21:56.060
<b>Suletta!</b>

21:56.540 --> 21:58.390
<b>Miorine!</b>

21:58.790 --> 22:00.480
<b>Everyone!</b>

22:01.620 --> 22:03.210
<b>Let's go home.</b>

22:03.210 --> 22:04.300
<b>Right!</b>

22:04.300 --> 22:06.900
<b>I'm feeling hungry.</b>

22:09.050 --> 22:10.570
<b>Me too.</b>

22:28.130 --> 22:33.850
<b>Episode 24</b>

23:46.940 --> 23:52.250
<b>Illustration: mogmog</b>

23:46.940 --> 23:52.250
<b>Thank you very much for watching the show until the end!</b>
